    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほっほっほ……
キッキョーヤ、
おぬしもワルやのぅ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ho ho ho... Well, Mr.
Fortune, aren't you
quite the villain!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんのなんの、
ジョーグン様ほどでは
ございません……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh me, oh my, but I
could never compare
to you, Lord Jogan...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……後は向こうの棚に
入ってる書類を処分すれば……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...After this, we'll only need to
dispose of the documents on
the shelf over there...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>国庫横領の証拠は
消える、と……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And no one will have evidence
we've been embezzling from
the treasury...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほっほっほ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ho ho ho...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんのなんの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh me, oh my...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>むむ……何ヤツ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mm!? Who's there!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273380</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>出あえ出あえ、曲者じゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Guards! Guards!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Suzu&gt;ちゃんにもらった
カラクリ人形が役に立ったぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That mechanical doll &lt;Suzu&gt;
lent me really is handy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……なんとかの“証拠”が
あっちの棚にあるって
言ってたな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Pretty sure they said
some kinda "evidence" is
on the shelf over there...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
